      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "NEAR MISS (1) filled the minor money two on end before breaking through for a deserved win last time, scoring at Bulli over 340m (19.08). The form out of last race has been strong. Well placed and can measure up. RHONDA'S RUPEES (7) box seated before sticking on well to finish 0.8 lengths away in second (23.11) at The Gardens in a Grade 5 over 400m. Must be included in calculations. LOOKS A TREAT (2) continues to race well but is struggling to break through, placing at her last four runs. Last start finished 2nd in a Grade 5 on November 18 over 300m at Taree Super Track behind Just Like Eddy beaten 0.8 lengths (17.40). The form out of the last run is proven to be strong. Well placed and gets her chance. LUNA'S SHAKE (5) found the frame here last start and looks a top-three hope again.",
